    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists won't change what happened. the internet doesn't forget. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize my own face anymore, because that person is gone. the person everyone knows now is just... this thing they created. it's not a symptom, it's just what's left. everything i built is just dust.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
