      "content": "It's understandable that you feel like what's past is permanent, but the narrative of who you are is constantly evolving, even if it feels impossible to see right now. The person you see in the mirror is a reflection of a part of you that is hurting, not the totality of who you are. Even when everything feels like dust, there is always the possibility of finding something new to build upon, even small things. Please consider reaching out to a crisis line if the despair feels too heavy to carry alone.",
